 "notes": [
  "GPU queue released: both runners killed before export; migrated processes SIGSTOP->snapshot->SIGKILL; status.json of every handed-off job set to HANDOFF; patched runner skips HANDOFF like DONE (no re-claim).",
  "checkpoint_step is the recoverable step derived from the state file (state_5000.pt=5000; RMA phase1_state.pt at its 200k boundary; QARL state.pt at its iteration boundary). counters.json in the snapshot may show higher log steps - resume must count from checkpoint_step.",
  "GPU keeps 22 model jobs (11 mbpo: hopper 0-4 + halfcheetah 0-4 + walker2d seed4; 11 rmbpo: hopper 0,3,4 + halfcheetah 2,3,4 + walker2d 0-4) plus all 66 source-protocol jobs (unclaimed this round, gated after shared).",
  "episodes parquet writes must not run concurrently against the same algo+task file across nodes; final merge dedups by (protocol,algo,task,seed) and verifies 30 episodes/condition."
 ],
